# FastH3 t2v with the FastVideo QAD-v2 transformer (NVFP4 W4A4 attention + MLP linears, quantization-aware distilled from
# the 8-Step V2; composed with V2's text encoder and full VAE by tools/download_models.sh) on the fused
# path with BF16 QK^T + E4M3 PV attention.
# Measured 2026-11-07, production: 8.62 s per clip (stock QAD eager 12.90 s, BF16 attention 9.49 s); teacher-forced error vs the BF16
# V2 teacher 0.272 / 0.161 (same as stock QAD's 0.273 / 0.156: a different model, distilled to NVFP4). Different but
# equally clean video for the same seed. t2v only (FV_ARGS is shared; Omni uses another checkpoint):
#   docker compose --env-file profiles/qad-nvfp4.env up -d t2v
FV_ARGS=--generator.model_path /root/.cache/huggingface/composed/fasth3-qad-v2-fullvae --generator.engine.compile.vae_enabled true --generator.engine.quantization.transformer_quant NVFP4 --generator.engine.quantization.layer_profile h3_dit_vsa
FASTVIDEO_H3_FP8_ATTN=pv
